  "body": "## Overview (Phase F3: P07–P10)\nImplements Major Phase F3 capabilities for TokTickIT Lab 3 (Work Packages P07, P08, P09, P10):\n\n- **P07 Requester Regression:** Upgrades Lab 2 requester endpoints to rely on session-authenticated identity instead of `X-Requester-Id` headers, while preserving complete regression compatibility for ticket creation, listing, detail, and attachments.\n- **P08 Staff Queue:** Multi-filter triage dashboard (`GET /api/staff/tickets`) with full-text search, status, priority, and ownership filters. Fully responsive with desktop table and mobile card views.\n- **P09 Staff Operations:** Claim unassigned, owner reassignment, IT priority updates, and status transitions following the 8-state lifecycle. Enforces **atomic optimistic concurrency locking** (`where: { id, version: expectedVersion }`) returning 409 `CONFLICT` on race conditions, plus write-time active owner eligibility checks.\n- **P10 Communication & Admin Read-Only Detail:** Append-only public comments, confidential internal notes (403 for requesters), \"Problem Appears Resolved\" requester flow, and Admin read-only detail view (`/admin/tickets/:id`) with suppressed operations and comment forms.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- **AC-14–AC-18 (P07):** Requester session identity regression.\n- **AC-19–AC-24 (P08):** Staff Queue search, filter, pagination, responsive layout.\n- **AC-25–AC-34 (P09):** Claim, reassign, IT priority, status progression, atomic optimistic locking.\n- **AC-35–AC-39, AC-28, AC-37 (P10):** Public comments, internal notes, appears-resolved, admin read-only detail view.\n\n## Verification Evidence\n- **Playwright E2E Suites (Strict Unconditional Assertions, No `if` Guards):**\n  - `staff-ticket-flow.spec.ts`: **36/36 passed** across Desktop (1280x800), Tablet (768x1024), and Mobile (375x667)\n  - `authentication.spec.ts`: **15/15 passed** across Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile\n  - `worker-env.spec.ts`: **3/3 passed**\n- **Server Test Suite (Backend):** **229/229 passed** (24 test files) on isolated disposable database (`toktickit_test`)\n- **Client Test Suite (Frontend):** **71/71 passed** (14 test files)\n- **TypeScript Builds:** Server `tsc` (0 errors) & Client `tsc && vite build` (0 errors)\n\nResolves #40",
